      "id": "claim_0952aeb656f1411cbce5237257ab786a",
      "statement": "The ComplianceDashboard audit modal is mounted by three host pages — the dashboard (apps/web/src/app/page.tsx army card), the Tabletop Console (apps/web/src/app/army/[id]/page.tsx) and the Roster Studio (apps/web/src/app/army/[id]/edit/page.tsx) — each keeping its own open flag, and only the dashboard passes dpLimit/currentDp, so the console and studio hosts rely on the defaults dpLimit=3 and currentDp=0.",
