      "statement": "ComplianceDashboard runs its audit automatically: a useEffect calls runAudit() when isOpen flips true (and again whenever the rosterId/currentPoints/pointsLimit/currentDp/dpLimit-derived callback identity changes while open), and the in-modal Re-Audit button calls the same runAudit, so results are always recomputed rather than cached.",
