      "id": "claim_d356fa942d114aa59ef74dc714b86b1f",
      "statement": "The audit UI has no write-back path today: the 'Sync Active Points (1-Click)' button only renders when POINTS_SHIFT discrepancies exist AND the optional onAutoFixPoints prop is supplied, no host supplies it, and handleApplyFix merely invokes the callback, shows a success banner and re-audits after 500ms; updateRoster is imported by the component but never called, so corrected costs reach storage only through the Roster Studio's debounced performSave.",
